fwOS Phase 2 basic firewall image
Topology: WAN=eth0 (DHCP client) | LAN=eth1 (10.10.10.1/24, DHCP 10.10.10.100-10.10.10.200)
Policy: default-deny unsolicited WAN ingress; NAT LAN->WAN; management from the LAN only.
SSH (LAN only): root / fwos — interim default credentials; console logins are automatic.
